  "icon": "minecraft:iron_ingot",
  "lore": [
    "Ore glitters in the Heartstone's memory now: iron, copper, gold, the patient grind of gears. The old craft-folk built machines that turned water into motion and motion into wonder.",
    "The Wroughtnaut stood guard over the forge-memories for ten thousand years. It doesn't remember why. It only remembers how to hit very hard.",
    "With the Thread Call awake, you can always feel where your partner is. Pull, and you're beside them."
  ],
